      "notes": [
        "The functional check launches, observes and reaps its own real child; it checks CPU/memory/open-file observations and exit status 7. It does not require root.",
        "Process information can disappear or be denied: handle psutil.NoSuchProcess, AccessDenied and TimeoutExpired in application code.",
        "System totals are observations exposed by the host/kernel and may differ from a container cgroup quota. CPU percentage needs an interval or two observations; the first nonblocking reading is not an established utilization measurement.",
